  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_70b2dd22-d290-4dac-8a5d-e33eb086dbef.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></p><p>Этот мод сделает руды и некоторые блоки Minecraft светящимися, НО также и различные моды, которые мы будем добавлять в каждое обновление!</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_5c1570d4-e48c-4236-9380-3b894992a2c3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></p><p>Этот мод совместим с:</p><p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/924/13/vanilla_blocks.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1069907/description_a6793505-09a1-4fdf-8d30-e64a7eda153c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1069907/description_2290e5d2-395e-448e-98ba-8be7051632ff.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1069907/description_b979dab2-f153-42c2-ad01-6d28b06980c4.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_878584d7-73fb-4c6f-966d-f071d1ad83c6.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_93e548f9-5ebc-458f-9f00-e7b5ccc08545.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_9b69ed0e-de00-4cd5-955a-ed579f75acd8.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1069907/description_abd926db-50d0-4de8-a3ae-e52311c9d33a.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_85444cf9-c4a9-4e8d-be42-f3b961ce644a.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/924/252/dungeons_plus_blocks.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1069907/description_d47bf811-31d8-458a-a57f-9a61342a38f7.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_1c5f2c25-eb7f-4e24-87cd-0420ef76c014.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_a1aff1a8-f297-4f82-ac27-c932dacfecd8.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_ed194378-2287-4085-8e1c-a902f32b42f4.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_e10000b5-4f8f-438c-b84e-06881c1ffa96.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"819\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_2a87dc43-75bd-4043-91c9-c4372892bf7d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_183fe7dc-137a-4499-b4e8-f9310a941d0a.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_85018b92-d7c0-4bc2-bf06-ffd52b77cfb2.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_f2f1f428-8565-461e-a401-76cfb9dcaf04.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"182\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_0fd15ad6-fbd8-46af-ac8a-c8b8acb11d82.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"182\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_1233b897-a2de-452b-825c-3af87c5b6a5a.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_de72b45a-b1f7-4231-9354-d7e9e071292a.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_8eac7c88-1bf1-472e-8c04-cbfc84251018.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"181\"></p><p>Что особенно выделяет наш мод среди других, так это его максимальная <strong>совместимость</strong> с <strongМНОГИМИ МОДАМИ</strong>, поэтому <strongРуды</strong> из ваших <strongЛюбимых модов</strong> также будут обладать этим эффектом <strongСвечение</strong>!&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_a07358a7-f5dc-49e1-a900-fe9e83fa662b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></p><h2><em>Как увидеть сверкающие руды, если я не использую Optifine?</em></h2><p>Если вы используете Embeddium, вам необходимо скачать эти 2 мода:<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-emissive-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMcmeta Emissive Textures (Forge)</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; |&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMcmeta (Forge)</a></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249404/description_abb6e840-67a7-44e3-9093-1be622b6775e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></p><p>Если вы хотите поддержать нас, присоединяйтесь к нашему <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/N6TsrGvzvZ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span> или окажите нам финансовую помощь на нашем <span style=\"color:#3598db\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/RenovatedStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N6TsrGvzvZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_f9406618-0e4f-4d0a-92da-5376ba49b9e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"354\" height=\"82\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/RenovatedStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_fb2b698d-66ca-4888-a0c3-460d706e5304.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"354\" height=\"82\"></a></span></p>",
